d{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"ddc83fc9163b4fc53f0138a4d833c2c74d8ccc56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/datasets/commits/ddc83fc9163b4fc53f0138a4d833c2c74d8ccc56","html_url":"https://github.com/huggingface/datasets/commit/ddc83fc9163b4fc53f0138a4d833c2c74d8ccc56"}]},{"sha":"f9ee6d469581e0ea4dc5a1c56b7ccb46b6176ce6","node_id":"C_kwDODunzptoAKGY5ZWU2ZDQ2OTU4MWUwZWE0ZGM1YTFjNTZiN2NjYjQ2YjYxNzZjZTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Steffen Hirte","email":"1706443+shirte@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2021-10-01T15:39:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2021-10-01T15:39:29Z"},"message":"Introduce web and wiki config in triviaqa dataset (#2949)\n\n* Introduce web and wiki config in triviaqa dataset\r\n\r\nThe TriviaQA paper suggests that the two subsets (Wikipedia and Web)\r\nshould be treated differently. There are also different leaderboards\r\nfor the two sets on CodaLab. For that reason, introduce additional\r\nbuilder configs in the trivia_qa dataset.\r\n\r\n* Remove invalid config wikipedia.unfiltered\r\n\r\n* Delete dummy_data directory\r\n\r\n* Add helper method in trivia_qa\r\n\r\n* Add dummy_data for all trivia_qa configs\r\n\r\n* Fix style\r\n\r\n* Add tags in TriviaQA dataset card\r\n\r\n* Fix typo\r\n\r\n* smaller dummy data\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Steffen Hirte <shirte@users.noreply.github.com>\r\nCo-authored-by: Quentin Lhoest <lhoest.q@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"aa6e17853225ec6ef65395826b1d294cdfb85b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/huggingface/datasets/git/trees/aa6e17853225ec6ef65395826b1d294cdfb